==Albanian==
{{wikipedia|More (interjection)}}

===Etymology===
Possibly a short form of {{der|sq|ine-pro|*bʰrā́ter||brother}} (a reflex of which is otherwise absent in Albanian), parallel to colloquialisms in other languages like {{cog|en|bro}} and {{cog|it|fra}}; but compare also {{cog|el|βρε}}, {{m|el|ρε}} and {{cog|mk|бре}}, {{m|mk|море}}, {{cog|xil|*bra}} with the same meaning, usually considered to derive from {{der|sq|el|μωρέ||stupid|pos=vocative}}. In the latter case, this word may be a {{doublet|sq|more|nocap=1}}.

===Interjection===
{{head|sq|interjection}}

# A friendly [[exclamation]] to a [[person]].
#: {{ux|sq|Folni '''bre''', burra!|Speak, '''therefore''', men!}}
# An [[exclamation]] of [[surprise]].
#: {{ux|sq|'''Bre'''! Po ç'është kjo?|'''Man'''! What is this?}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|sq|brez}}
* {{l|sq|pra}}

